meta {
  name: storage.local.put
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

put {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/storage/local/put
  body: text
  auth: none
}

params:query {
  key: {{up_key}}
  exp: {{up_exp}}
  ct: {{up_ct}}
  fn: {{up_fn}}
  sig: {{up_sig}}
}

headers {
  Content-Type: text/plain
}

body:text {
  Xin chao SoE Hub
}

docs {
  Chỉ dùng khi STORAGE_DRIVER=local (dev). Với S3/R2, gửi PUT thẳng tới `upload.url` do `file.upload.init` trả về.
}
